<article class="env-lemma" id="0DPN">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DPN">Lemma <span data-tag="0DPN">108.10.2</span>.</a> The morphism $\mathit{Mor}_ B(Y, X) \to B$ is separated and locally of finite presentation. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      To check $\mathit{Mor}_ B(Y, X) \to B$ is separated we have to show that its diagonal is a closed immersion. This is true by Lemma <a href="/tag/0DPM" data-tag="0DPM">108.10.1</a>. The second statement is part of Quot, Proposition <a href="/tag/0D1C" data-tag="0D1C">99.12.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>